's Republican lean leave Hudson clearly favored, with some room for the race to tighten if outside spending escalates.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0964, "margin": -7.77}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.1187, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1157, "margin": -8.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.1153, "margin": -8.5}]}